    <content:encoded>Way back in 2009 I took a friend up to the Bay Area and he &lt;a href="https://flyingsummers.com/2008/09/14/more-fame/"&gt;shot a little film of it&lt;/a&gt;.

And one of the latest passengers has written a book of poems about a flight up the west coast to Seattle in N972RD. &lt;a href="https://www.amazon.com/Fixed-Base-Operator-Alexandra-Weiss-ebook/dp/B01N91Z7P4/" target="_blank"&gt;Check it out on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;.

